guarantee: I11: a PendingId is never handed out twice (within one process, across seeds)
file: crates/voicen-core/src/pipeline.rs
added_by: test-writer
--- old
                self.last_pending_id
                    .fetch_add(1, Ordering::Relaxed)
--- new
                self.last_pending_id
                    .fetch_add(0, Ordering::Relaxed)
--- end
